==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|symbolique|lang=fr}} or directly from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|symbolicus|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|συμβολικός||tr=symbolikos|lang=grc|of or belonging to a [[symbol]]}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɒlɪk}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Pertaining to a [[symbol]].
# Referring to something with an [[implicit]] meaning.

